  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="26">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 26</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="26" corresp="#wit-g">Ac lufige man Godes riht heonan forð georne wordes ⁊ dæda; þon<hi rend="italic">ne</hi> wyrð þysse þeode sona God milde.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="26" corresp="#wit-g2">Ac lufige man Godes riht heonan forð georne wordes ⁊ dæde; þonne wyrð þysse þeode sona God milde.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="26" corresp="#wit-d">Ac lufige man Godes riht heonan forð georne wordes ⁊ dæda; þonne wurð þisse þeode sona God milde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-d">But the law of God shall henceforth be zealously cherished both in word and in deed; then forthwith God will have mercy upon this nation.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Sondern man achte hinfort Gottes Gebot sorgsam in Wort und That; dann wird Gott alsbald diesem Volke gnädig werden.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">But let God's law be eagerly loved henceforth in word and deed; then God will soon become merciful to this people.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
